WEBVTT

00:42.042 --> 00:46.963
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

00:47.881 --> 00:51.885
3 YEARS AGO, WEDDING DAY

01:54.197 --> 01:56.324
That bedroom is yours from now on.

01:56.407 --> 01:58.576
I won't be going into that room.

02:04.541 --> 02:06.709
I'll use the room near the entrance,

02:06.793 --> 02:09.462
and I don't want you in here either.

02:37.157 --> 02:38.658
Did you not read my text?

02:38.741 --> 02:40.743
I told you there was no need
to prepare meals.

02:41.578 --> 02:44.247
I don't know when I'll leave work,
so don't wait up.

02:48.126 --> 02:49.169
What if…

02:50.587 --> 02:52.755
I had told you back then

02:54.340 --> 02:57.010
that I felt at ease
with you in this house,

03:03.224 --> 03:04.934
that I was glad you became my wife,

03:05.602 --> 03:07.896
and that I couldn't sleep a wink
because of you…

03:40.136 --> 03:40.970
Hong Hee-joo,

03:42.013 --> 03:43.640
do you like being married to me

03:44.474 --> 03:45.475
or not?

03:47.852 --> 03:49.020
If you don't hate it,

03:50.521 --> 03:51.814
how about we slowly…

03:53.775 --> 03:55.360
get to know each other better?

04:03.534 --> 04:06.037
Instead of dedicating it
to hatred and revenge,

04:07.038 --> 04:08.790
if I had dedicated my life

04:09.457 --> 04:11.125
to love and happiness with you…

04:13.086 --> 04:14.671
I'm now paying the price

04:17.298 --> 04:18.841
for not doing that,

04:19.842 --> 04:20.969
Hee-joo.

04:21.594 --> 04:23.263
EPISODE 11

04:29.811 --> 04:32.313
I can't find Hee-joo! We were together.

04:33.189 --> 04:34.065
I'll find her.

04:35.191 --> 04:36.276
Hee-joo!

04:37.235 --> 04:38.152
Hee-joo!

04:43.533 --> 04:44.617
Hee-joo!

04:47.954 --> 04:49.455
UNKNOWN CALLER

04:52.875 --> 04:54.043
Paik Sa-eon.

04:55.795 --> 04:57.964
I'll kill her.

04:59.299 --> 05:01.134
I'm really going to kill her.

05:02.010 --> 05:03.219
Your wife.

05:07.473 --> 05:10.685
Hee-joo, don't worry. I'm coming.

05:10.768 --> 05:12.854
- I'm coming right now.
- Don't come.

05:16.899 --> 05:18.443
I told you.

05:20.278 --> 05:21.529
For once,

05:22.655 --> 05:24.282
I want to protect you.

05:25.366 --> 05:26.784
Just remember this.

05:27.910 --> 05:29.162
I love you…

05:33.833 --> 05:35.418
so very much.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.087
Hee-joo.

05:38.171 --> 05:39.422
I love you.

05:44.469 --> 05:46.471
You crazy bitch! Again with that?

05:47.055 --> 05:48.431
Do you remember?

05:48.514 --> 05:50.975
Once you start,
you see it through to the end.

05:51.559 --> 05:52.602
That's what you said.

05:52.685 --> 05:53.936
Since I started it,

05:54.562 --> 05:56.731
I'm going to end it.

05:56.814 --> 05:59.150
I'll make sure
you never make him suffer again!

06:04.072 --> 06:05.156
Hee-joo…

06:06.115 --> 06:07.241
Hee-joo!

06:33.267 --> 06:34.268
NO VEHICLE ENTRY

07:11.639 --> 07:13.391
- Hello?
- We found it.

07:26.988 --> 07:29.115
You said you found it. What did you find?

07:29.907 --> 07:30.908
I don't see the car.

07:31.659 --> 07:32.660
Well…

07:34.745 --> 07:35.663
It seems the car

07:36.539 --> 07:38.708
was going very fast
at the time of the accident.

07:40.877 --> 07:43.963
It hit this guardrail
and went straight down.

07:55.516 --> 07:56.601
Also,

07:57.852 --> 07:58.853
we found this

07:59.604 --> 08:00.605
at the scene.

08:12.867 --> 08:13.701
I think…

08:15.119 --> 08:16.621
we should start the search.

08:32.136 --> 08:33.221
What happened?

08:33.888 --> 08:34.889
Where's Hee-joo?

08:34.972 --> 08:35.890
Did the car…

08:36.974 --> 08:38.559
fall down there?

08:40.978 --> 08:42.063
No way.

08:42.146 --> 08:43.940
- Hee-joo!
- Honey, calm down.

08:44.023 --> 08:46.984
Calm down, honey!
Will you start the search right away?

08:52.823 --> 08:55.493
Why did you spare him and let this happen?

08:55.576 --> 08:57.870
Bring that bastard to me right now!

08:57.954 --> 08:59.497
What the hell are you saying?

08:59.580 --> 09:01.290
Who says I spared him?

09:01.374 --> 09:02.959
Your father tricked me!

09:03.042 --> 09:04.544
That sly old fox!

09:04.627 --> 09:06.170
That's enough!

09:06.254 --> 09:08.130
What's the point of blaming anyone now?

09:08.214 --> 09:10.508
Since when did you care
about your children?

09:10.591 --> 09:13.344
Don't you know
you brought this upon yourself?

09:13.427 --> 09:14.929
You can find Hee-joo, right?

09:15.638 --> 09:18.641
Please, find her. Hee-joo…

09:20.309 --> 09:21.143
Hee-joo.

09:22.895 --> 09:23.813
Hee-joo…

09:38.202 --> 09:40.830
My mother didn't come.

09:40.913 --> 09:42.123
What?

09:47.044 --> 09:48.629
Yes, we checked them all.

09:49.922 --> 09:50.756
We don't see her.

09:50.840 --> 09:53.342
We checked all the mourners' dashcams,

09:53.426 --> 09:56.095
but Professor Shim Kyu-jin
wasn't on any of them.

09:56.762 --> 09:59.181
The back gate cameras
are for real-time monitoring,

09:59.765 --> 10:01.142
so they weren't recording.

10:02.560 --> 10:03.728
I understand.

10:50.566 --> 10:52.735
NO RECORDED VIDEOS

11:02.495 --> 11:03.329
Yes.

11:03.412 --> 11:05.623
The dashcam footage
from Professor Shim's car

11:05.706 --> 11:06.916
has been deleted.

11:06.999 --> 11:09.877
Seize and recover it,
and check her phone and location data

11:09.960 --> 11:12.088
to find out where she was
during the accident.

11:12.171 --> 11:14.465
Okay, I'll request a search warrant first.

11:35.569 --> 11:37.154
What are you doing here?

11:41.158 --> 11:42.159
What are you doing?

11:47.665 --> 11:48.999
You haven't been crying.

11:49.625 --> 11:53.712
You don't know whether your son
is alive or dead right now,

11:53.796 --> 11:55.714
yet you didn't come to the scene

11:56.799 --> 11:57.967
or cry.

11:59.802 --> 12:01.262
You're something else.

12:01.887 --> 12:02.805
Why…

12:05.099 --> 12:06.392
should I cry?

12:12.523 --> 12:14.525
Your father, Paik Jang-ho,

12:14.608 --> 12:16.944
said my son fell into the water

12:17.027 --> 12:19.488
and drowned when he took him fishing.

12:20.573 --> 12:24.368
We searched the entire lake,
but the boy was nowhere to be found.

12:28.038 --> 12:30.291
I struggled in agony,

12:30.374 --> 12:33.544
not knowing whether my son
was alive or dead,

12:34.295 --> 12:37.047
beating my chest
as I cried and cried again.

12:38.382 --> 12:41.260
Whenever I heard
that a body had been found washed up,

12:42.428 --> 12:43.846
I ran barefoot to the scene.

12:46.974 --> 12:48.058
I already did that

12:50.144 --> 12:52.438
more than enough 20 years ago.

12:55.691 --> 12:56.609
And now,

13:00.946 --> 13:02.156
isn't it your turn…

13:03.866 --> 13:06.160
to experience that pain?

13:14.710 --> 13:17.338
Since Spokesperson Paik Sa-eon's
press conference…

13:17.421 --> 13:18.422
4 DAYS SINCE THE ACCIDENT

13:18.506 --> 13:20.633
…search operations have continued,

13:20.716 --> 13:22.635
but Ms. Hong Hee-joo
has not been found yet.

13:22.718 --> 13:25.638
Rescue authorities have announced plans

13:25.721 --> 13:27.973
to expand the search area downriver.

13:30.142 --> 13:31.977
NEXT NEWS. HOUSING LEASE SCAMS HAVE…

13:33.521 --> 13:35.397
What's going on? Why did she stop?

13:39.902 --> 13:41.320
You-ri, keep going!

13:45.407 --> 13:48.661
Dear viewers,
we earnestly ask for your cooperation.

13:48.744 --> 13:50.371
Please lend your attention and support,

13:50.454 --> 13:52.748
so Hong Hee-joo can return

13:52.831 --> 13:55.918
to her family's arms as soon as possible.

14:03.801 --> 14:04.885
You think it'll be okay?

14:06.804 --> 14:07.721
I'm fine.

14:08.347 --> 14:10.891
I still have a lot of energy left.

14:10.975 --> 14:11.934
No, the weather.

14:15.020 --> 14:16.313
They said it won't rain.

14:17.106 --> 14:18.983
Surely the sky won't turn against us.

14:20.484 --> 14:21.485
Let's pray.

14:22.111 --> 14:24.697
I'm not religious.
I've never prayed this much.

14:32.538 --> 14:33.372
Me too.

14:35.374 --> 14:37.877
By the way, when are you going to ask me?

14:38.836 --> 14:39.837
About what?

14:39.920 --> 14:43.507
Whether or not I knew
Hee-joo was Paik Sa-eon's wife,

14:44.216 --> 14:46.051
and why I didn't tell you if I did.

14:48.178 --> 14:50.890
You told me to hear it for myself.

14:50.973 --> 14:52.808
Were you talking about Hee-joo?

14:53.434 --> 14:55.227
Yeah. I'm sorry.

14:56.061 --> 14:57.396
Why would you be sorry?

14:58.063 --> 14:59.398
Hee-joo should apologize.

15:01.984 --> 15:04.278
"Did you have fun
fooling me all this time?"

15:05.279 --> 15:08.073
"You really went too far."
I'll confront her.

15:08.157 --> 15:09.742
I will get an apology from her.

15:14.914 --> 15:16.498
Hee-joo's in big trouble.

15:17.166 --> 15:18.417
She's really going to get it.

15:21.211 --> 15:22.546
Hey, you know what?

15:24.089 --> 15:25.299
Hee-joo can talk too.

15:26.800 --> 15:29.219
She can… what?

15:29.303 --> 15:30.846
She talks really well.

15:31.639 --> 15:33.265
She's got a great voice too.

15:42.691 --> 15:43.651
This won't do.

15:45.653 --> 15:47.446
- Step on it?
- Yeah.

15:47.529 --> 15:49.865
Let's find Hee-joo quickly.

15:49.949 --> 15:50.950
I need to find her

15:52.743 --> 15:55.162
and hear that voice for myself.

16:10.886 --> 16:13.305
VOLUNTEER GROUP

16:14.223 --> 16:15.891
Shall we gather around?

16:15.975 --> 16:16.892
Okay.

16:20.437 --> 16:22.982
Let's get started for today.

16:23.065 --> 16:25.067
Everyone, please stay alert,

16:25.150 --> 16:26.819
be careful, and stay safe.

16:26.902 --> 16:28.904
- Let's begin.
- Okay.

16:37.204 --> 16:38.956
HONG HEE-JOO
PRESIDENTIAL OFFICE INTERPRETER

16:41.000 --> 16:43.085
Ms. Han…

16:47.297 --> 16:48.298
I'm so sorry.

16:49.133 --> 16:50.551
Something got in my eye.

16:54.638 --> 16:57.016
There they are. Over here.

17:04.940 --> 17:07.568
Sorry we're late.
You're all here today as well.

17:08.444 --> 17:10.696
Thank you for your help.

17:11.447 --> 17:13.240
I should be thanking you.

17:13.323 --> 17:16.493
You are all stepping up like this,

17:17.911 --> 17:19.413
and I'm so grateful.

17:25.502 --> 17:28.088
By the way, where's Sa-eon?

17:29.548 --> 17:31.175
Yeah, he's normally at the scene.

17:31.258 --> 17:34.970
He received a call
and left only a little while ago.

17:35.054 --> 17:36.388
To where?

17:36.472 --> 17:38.807
We don't know. He left in such a hurry.

17:41.268 --> 17:45.522
EVIDENCE
CHAIN OF CUSTODY, ON-SITE EVIDENCE

17:46.398 --> 17:47.566
Please check

17:49.401 --> 17:50.903
if it belongs to Hong Hee-joo.

17:57.451 --> 17:59.161
ON-SITE EVIDENCE

18:03.123 --> 18:06.418
Downstream from where these were found,
there's a dam.

18:07.419 --> 18:10.339
She hasn't been found
even after searching this area…

18:12.216 --> 18:14.551
- So the chances of survival--
- You can tell me…

18:17.387 --> 18:18.722
when her body is found.

18:18.806 --> 18:19.640
Excuse me?

18:21.558 --> 18:22.559
You can save that…

18:24.144 --> 18:25.687
for when her body is found.

18:27.022 --> 18:30.359
We still need to search more.

18:32.653 --> 18:34.279
What about the search warrant?

18:34.988 --> 18:35.989
We still don't have it?

18:37.491 --> 18:39.284
I just got a call about that.

18:40.369 --> 18:41.495
It was rejected.

18:41.578 --> 18:44.581
It's hard to prove the charges
with just suspicions or statements,

18:45.165 --> 18:46.542
and as you well know,

18:47.292 --> 18:50.170
she is the wife
of the leading presidential candidate.

18:50.254 --> 18:53.590
She's also the prime suspect.

18:55.342 --> 18:56.760
Request the warrant again.

18:57.845 --> 19:00.514
There's a way to get it.

19:03.100 --> 19:04.434
Twenty-four years ago,

19:05.185 --> 19:07.980
my son went to the lake
with his grandfather

19:09.982 --> 19:11.483
and never came back.

19:13.068 --> 19:15.445
We were unable to find his body,

19:16.488 --> 19:17.489
and we couldn't…

19:19.199 --> 19:20.826
accept our child's death.

19:22.286 --> 19:23.120
So,

19:24.329 --> 19:26.081
we couldn't register his death.

19:29.126 --> 19:30.043
Then, one day,

19:30.669 --> 19:32.546
at the fishing spot my son used to visit,

19:32.629 --> 19:36.216
we met a child who had grown up there
without parents or even a name.

19:36.300 --> 19:38.051
He's the Sa-eon who's with us now.

19:40.262 --> 19:42.514
Sa-eon was the same age as our son,

19:43.974 --> 19:45.309
and to us,

19:46.351 --> 19:47.936
it felt like fate.

19:56.778 --> 19:58.030
- Is it this way?
- Yes.

20:00.157 --> 20:02.451
I'm Jang Hyeok-jin with HBC.
I have a question.

20:03.243 --> 20:06.413
Why didn't your biological son
search for his parents,

20:07.080 --> 20:10.209
and why is he seeking revenge
against Spokesperson Paik Sa-eon?

20:10.292 --> 20:12.127
You can ask questions later…

20:12.211 --> 20:13.420
It's fine.

20:14.713 --> 20:16.131
I'll answer your question.

20:18.050 --> 20:18.884
Among people,

20:20.302 --> 20:23.305
there are rumors that my son
threatened Spokesperson Paik

20:23.931 --> 20:26.308
and made death threats.

20:26.391 --> 20:28.185
But they are not true.

20:29.311 --> 20:32.147
My son has not been
in a sound state of mind

20:32.231 --> 20:34.149
since the lake accident--

20:34.233 --> 20:36.652
The blackmail and murder threats
are not true?

20:36.735 --> 20:40.155
There's audio of your son's voice
and phone conversation recorded

20:40.239 --> 20:43.116
on the spokesperson's dashcam
during Hong Hee-joo's kidnapping.

20:43.200 --> 20:44.159
That's not all.

20:44.243 --> 20:45.911
There are testimonies linking him

20:45.994 --> 20:49.331
to the Sinil Childcare Center
abduction and murder cases.

20:50.082 --> 20:51.458
Shall we hear it?

20:52.668 --> 20:54.086
I first saw him

20:54.753 --> 20:57.005
near the Presidential Office last year.

20:58.257 --> 20:59.258
What is that?

21:00.425 --> 21:03.595
A statement from the suspect's accomplice.
Let's listen further.

21:09.226 --> 21:10.811
It was the first time

21:10.894 --> 21:12.980
I'd seen someone with such animosity

21:13.063 --> 21:14.439
toward Paik Sa-eon.

21:14.523 --> 21:15.357
Damn it!

21:15.941 --> 21:17.025
Get him out of here.

21:18.026 --> 21:19.361
Paik Sa-eon, get out here!

21:20.529 --> 21:21.947
Paik Sa-eon!

21:23.907 --> 21:24.866
What's going on?

21:25.492 --> 21:28.036
That man kept insisting
on meeting the spokesperson,

21:28.120 --> 21:31.164
- trying to barge in without permission.
- Let go of me, bastards!

21:32.416 --> 21:34.418
I'll be back!

21:35.294 --> 21:36.211
I promise!

21:36.878 --> 21:40.674
I'll kill Paik Sa-eon myself!

21:48.265 --> 21:50.017
I wondered, "Is he a victim too?"

21:51.768 --> 21:55.564
"Will I be able to
make use of his hatred?"

21:56.690 --> 22:00.193
I followed him around for a few days
to see if we shared the same goal.

22:01.194 --> 22:02.112
That's when

22:02.654 --> 22:05.198
I saw him head to an important location.

22:05.824 --> 22:07.117
An important location?

22:18.920 --> 22:22.674
He knew where the orphaned children
and my brother had gone missing.

22:23.717 --> 22:24.551
That's why…

22:25.844 --> 22:27.763
I was sure he was a victim like me.

22:35.437 --> 22:36.897
Who are you?

22:38.190 --> 22:41.359
Why do you want to take revenge
on Paik Sa-eon?

22:45.072 --> 22:47.407
He said he grew up at the fishing spot.

22:48.283 --> 22:49.284
Paik Jang-ho

22:49.910 --> 22:52.204
brought the bodies of the victims
his grandson had killed

22:52.287 --> 22:53.705
to the owner of the fishing spot…

22:53.789 --> 22:55.373
Take care of it!

22:59.211 --> 23:01.463
One day, just because
he saw his grandson's face,

23:01.546 --> 23:03.799
Paik Jang-ho tried to drown him.

23:03.882 --> 23:06.551
Since then,
he's been living in an impaired state.

23:06.635 --> 23:07.928
He said he wanted revenge

23:08.720 --> 23:11.056
on the Paik family
for making him that way.

23:11.973 --> 23:13.225
It was all a lie, though.

23:16.144 --> 23:18.063
Sure. Take it.

23:18.688 --> 23:20.440
The police already have it.

23:20.524 --> 23:21.733
Now, everyone!

23:22.317 --> 23:25.695
Two people are missing at the moment,
and their fate is unknown.

23:25.779 --> 23:26.738
Right now,

23:27.322 --> 23:30.575
we shouldn't be swayed
by baseless rumors or fake news…

23:35.455 --> 23:36.414
How can I help you?

23:40.335 --> 23:41.419
Are you Shim Kyu-jin?

23:45.841 --> 23:46.675
I am.

23:48.802 --> 23:51.680
I'm Detective Kang Hyeong-cheol
from the Violent Crimes Unit.

23:51.763 --> 23:55.767
You're under arrest
as a suspect in a murder case.

23:57.561 --> 23:58.728
What are you saying?

23:59.437 --> 24:00.772
- Wait!
- Shim Kyu-jin…

24:01.648 --> 24:03.441
You have the right to remain silent

24:04.025 --> 24:05.861
and the right to an attorney.

24:06.486 --> 24:07.946
Anything you say can

24:08.029 --> 24:10.282
and will be used against you
in a court of law.

24:10.907 --> 24:12.200
- Take her.
- Move!

24:12.284 --> 24:13.493
- Move aside.
- Wait!

24:30.635 --> 24:32.220
HEE-JOO

24:32.304 --> 24:33.221
SPEAKER

24:33.305 --> 24:37.726
The phone you called is turned off.
You'll be directed to voicemail.

24:37.809 --> 24:39.853
Additional fees may apply after the beep.

24:45.400 --> 24:46.484
I…

24:49.237 --> 24:51.573
wanted you to live
a different life from mine.

24:52.282 --> 24:53.700
To live without hardship,

24:53.783 --> 24:55.744
marry into a wealthy family,

24:55.827 --> 24:58.538
wear beautiful clothes,
and indulge in luxury.

25:00.040 --> 25:01.499
That's the life I wanted for you.

25:02.542 --> 25:05.545
I thought it was for your own good, but…

25:09.591 --> 25:11.426
But no matter how hard I try,

25:13.011 --> 25:14.179
I can't remember it.

25:15.722 --> 25:17.390
I don't think I ever saw it.

25:19.935 --> 25:21.937
Your smile, Hee-joo.

25:40.288 --> 25:41.581
Why are you doing nothing?

25:42.290 --> 25:44.084
You should be doing something!

25:44.167 --> 25:45.335
Why?

25:45.418 --> 25:48.296
Are you afraid that stepping forward
will expose the deal you made

25:48.380 --> 25:50.006
with Chairman Paik 20 years ago?

25:51.508 --> 25:52.342
Fine.

25:53.134 --> 25:55.095
If you can't do it, I will.

25:55.178 --> 25:58.098
This tragedy between our two families.

25:58.807 --> 26:00.684
The world deserves to know
why it happened.

26:01.476 --> 26:02.477
Will doing that…

26:03.687 --> 26:04.938
change anything?

26:05.021 --> 26:07.023
What will change if we do nothing?

26:08.275 --> 26:11.611
You saw what happened when you did nothing

26:12.153 --> 26:14.990
after losing your son 20 years ago!

26:15.991 --> 26:18.410
Honey!

26:19.077 --> 26:20.996
What does this mean?

26:21.079 --> 26:21.997
What's wrong?

26:23.206 --> 26:25.166
PAIK UI-YONG'S WIFE ARRESTED FOR MURDER

26:25.250 --> 26:27.168
What… For murder?

26:27.252 --> 26:29.504
Who did this wench kill?

26:31.965 --> 26:32.882
She didn't, right?

26:33.967 --> 26:34.968
Not Hee-joo, right?

26:50.608 --> 26:51.443
So,

26:52.152 --> 26:54.362
has a body been found or something?

26:55.989 --> 26:58.325
- What body?
- You said it was a murder charge.

26:59.617 --> 27:02.787
Didn't you bring me here
because I killed someone?

27:04.080 --> 27:04.914
Before that,

27:07.042 --> 27:10.503
are you prepared to lose your badge?

27:10.587 --> 27:13.381
I could get you fired
for defamation or abuse of power,

27:13.965 --> 27:15.717
if I wanted to.

27:17.719 --> 27:19.262
Have we found a body?

27:20.930 --> 27:23.725
Do you think you're here for murder

27:24.309 --> 27:26.102
of the missing Hong Hee-joo?

27:53.922 --> 27:56.174
Do you admit to the murder charge?

27:57.717 --> 27:58.718
How…

28:00.595 --> 28:01.596
did you get this?

28:33.002 --> 28:34.754
Grandfather's signet ring.

28:34.838 --> 28:38.425
He gave it to me a few days
before he passed away.

28:41.469 --> 28:42.345
A few days later,

28:44.013 --> 28:45.181
I returned it to him.

28:48.143 --> 28:49.561
I told him it wasn't right

28:50.478 --> 28:52.439
for me to take it then.

29:02.240 --> 29:03.533
That's when the video was taken.

29:05.034 --> 29:06.953
Right before Grandfather passed away,

29:07.620 --> 29:09.080
that moment of truth.

29:10.874 --> 29:14.461
BACKGROUND CHECK
SHIM KYU-JIN

29:26.347 --> 29:27.682
Kyu-jin.

29:28.349 --> 29:30.560
You've gone through a lot…

29:31.770 --> 29:34.355
living as my daughter-in-law.

29:35.106 --> 29:36.107
Now…

29:38.902 --> 29:40.445
you're asking for forgiveness?

29:41.404 --> 29:42.781
Forgiveness?

29:46.826 --> 29:48.161
Are you talking about…

29:49.788 --> 29:51.873
the sin of sending your son to his death

29:52.749 --> 29:54.292
with my own hands?

29:54.375 --> 29:55.752
There's one more.

29:57.003 --> 29:58.171
The sin…

29:58.880 --> 30:00.882
of replacing my son with yours.

30:02.217 --> 30:03.218
So,

30:04.344 --> 30:06.888
you knew all along.

30:06.971 --> 30:08.348
I didn't at first.

30:10.683 --> 30:13.436
As soon as my son died,
you brought an orphan

30:14.479 --> 30:18.066
and shoved him into my arms,
telling me to raise him as Sa-eon.

30:19.108 --> 30:22.654
But as I watched that child
become more and more like you,

30:23.363 --> 30:24.781
I saw

30:25.490 --> 30:28.159
how lovingly you gazed at him

30:28.243 --> 30:30.578
and how proud you were of him…

30:31.871 --> 30:33.122
I couldn't help but know.

30:34.332 --> 30:39.712
The joy and glory that comes with raising
a child should have been mine,

30:39.796 --> 30:42.841
but you enjoyed it instead of me.

30:42.924 --> 30:45.426
No.

30:47.428 --> 30:50.181
I spared you the pain

30:50.765 --> 30:55.436
and tragedy you would have faced

30:55.520 --> 30:58.147
if your child had lived.

31:02.235 --> 31:03.236
Until the very end,

31:06.823 --> 31:08.950
you still won't ask for forgiveness.

31:15.915 --> 31:16.749
Then,

31:19.544 --> 31:20.753
I'll do it for you.

31:29.971 --> 31:31.973
Forgive me, Father.

32:01.336 --> 32:02.503
People…

32:04.297 --> 32:05.715
tend to tell the truth

32:07.091 --> 32:08.927
when the final moment comes.

32:09.594 --> 32:10.929
That's why I kept this.

32:11.554 --> 32:13.640
For the moment

32:13.723 --> 32:16.643
when your lifelong secret
finally comes to light.

32:16.726 --> 32:17.852
You are…

32:19.604 --> 32:21.481
indeed Paik Jang-ho's son.

32:22.649 --> 32:25.944
So, you'll make me pay the price
for killing your father.

32:28.905 --> 32:31.074
I didn't record it for him.

32:31.699 --> 32:34.535
I've been saving this for the day

32:36.496 --> 32:38.456
the ugly truth of this family is exposed.

32:39.457 --> 32:41.542
But I never imagined

32:42.835 --> 32:44.087
I'd have to use it

32:45.004 --> 32:46.172
not to ruin someone

32:47.340 --> 32:48.466
but to save someone.

32:53.179 --> 32:54.013
Mother.

32:55.056 --> 32:56.391
Now, tell me.

32:56.474 --> 32:58.518
Where's Hee-joo?

32:58.601 --> 33:00.269
What did you do with her?

33:00.979 --> 33:04.273
The police already have your phone
and dashcam.

33:04.941 --> 33:08.027
It'll work in your favor if you confess
before the evidence comes out.

33:08.861 --> 33:10.530
You know that better than anyone.

33:17.036 --> 33:19.622
OVERALL PROGRESS

33:27.588 --> 33:29.966
CONNECTING TO ACQUISITION PROCESS

33:33.261 --> 33:34.262
But…

33:34.846 --> 33:36.264
I'm curious about something.

33:42.020 --> 33:42.937
Fine.

33:43.021 --> 33:44.939
Let's say I had her kidnapped.

33:45.815 --> 33:49.360
But what you really want to find
isn't her body,

33:50.528 --> 33:52.447
it's her alive, isn't it?

33:56.784 --> 33:58.036
So tell me.

33:59.370 --> 34:02.498
Is there any reason
I should keep her alive?

34:03.166 --> 34:05.043
I'm not keeping her as a hostage,

34:05.626 --> 34:07.253
so why would I keep her alive?

34:08.296 --> 34:11.257
If it were you, would you have
bothered keeping her alive?

35:05.186 --> 35:06.854
Yes, Professor. I found them.

35:08.856 --> 35:10.525
What should I do with Hee-joo?

35:11.109 --> 35:11.984
What?

35:13.236 --> 35:14.153
I understand.

35:30.128 --> 35:31.379
If it were you,

35:33.589 --> 35:35.508
you would've kept her alive.

35:36.467 --> 35:38.094
For me.

35:38.177 --> 35:39.720
For you?

35:42.390 --> 35:43.891
You said it before.

35:45.685 --> 35:48.604
The pain of not knowing
whether he was dead or alive,

35:49.689 --> 35:53.276
struggling, pounding your chest,
crying and crying.

35:54.318 --> 35:56.654
Whenever a body was found
floating in the water,

35:56.737 --> 35:58.990
you ran barefoot in that agony.

36:01.075 --> 36:02.535
You said it was my turn now.

36:03.786 --> 36:04.620
Right.

36:05.580 --> 36:06.581
I did.

36:08.040 --> 36:10.126
That wouldn't have been enough for you.

36:10.918 --> 36:12.837
You would've gone even further.

36:14.297 --> 36:17.800
You would have looked for a way
to torment me,

36:19.552 --> 36:21.304
the son of Paik Jang-ho,

36:22.805 --> 36:24.807
until the very end.

36:30.730 --> 36:31.647
How's it going?

36:32.315 --> 36:33.900
- We have security footage.
- Pull it up.

36:35.860 --> 36:37.153
The one on the right.

36:37.653 --> 36:38.779
Zoom in.

37:13.105 --> 37:15.233
You haven't eaten anything for days.

37:18.569 --> 37:20.196
Are you planning to starve to death?

37:24.200 --> 37:25.034
Why?

37:31.916 --> 37:33.501
I could've had you killed.

37:34.794 --> 37:35.670
Instead,

37:37.046 --> 37:39.757
I brought you here and saved your life.

37:43.594 --> 37:45.221
So why are you trying to die?

37:46.806 --> 37:48.557
Because I know what you're up to.

37:52.520 --> 37:53.729
What I'm up to?

37:56.107 --> 37:57.566
What's that?

37:57.650 --> 38:01.821
He's probably searching for me
like crazy right now.

38:07.159 --> 38:08.202
One year.

38:09.036 --> 38:10.037
Two years.

38:10.121 --> 38:12.665
And then, after about ten years…

38:16.210 --> 38:17.920
he'll probably give up,

38:20.965 --> 38:22.300
thinking I'm dead.

38:24.302 --> 38:25.928
He'll just come to accept it.

38:27.805 --> 38:30.558
Then, one day,
after more than 20 years have passed…

38:34.603 --> 38:35.938
You want him…

38:36.022 --> 38:37.315
…to eventually find out,

38:38.441 --> 38:39.442
after all these years…

38:39.525 --> 38:42.570
…that his beloved, whom he thought
was dead, was actually alive.

38:42.653 --> 38:46.449
Then, I'll mourn the days
we couldn't be together.

38:46.532 --> 38:47.908
Filled with regret

38:49.452 --> 38:50.703
and sorrow,

38:51.454 --> 38:53.873
he will beat his chest in despair.

38:58.252 --> 38:59.670
For me,

39:00.504 --> 39:03.174
you would've prepared that final pain.

39:06.218 --> 39:07.303
If it were you.

39:11.974 --> 39:12.933
We found Hong Hee-joo.

39:19.231 --> 39:21.984
- Check the address and move quickly!
- Yes, sir!

39:24.737 --> 39:25.821
SEONGNANG POLICE STATION

39:29.408 --> 39:32.078
PROFESSOR SHIM KYU-JIN ARRESTED
FOR MURDERING PAIK JANG-HO

39:42.963 --> 39:43.798
If…

39:44.465 --> 39:46.759
anything happens to me,

39:46.842 --> 39:49.178
take care of the rest, Mr. Min.

40:35.891 --> 40:37.643
Save my son.

41:11.177 --> 41:12.261
And

41:13.387 --> 41:14.638
kill her.

41:32.948 --> 41:33.782
Please…

41:35.409 --> 41:36.410
Hee-joo, hold on.

42:24.333 --> 42:25.334
Ms. Hee-joo!

42:29.004 --> 42:30.005
Run away.

42:31.090 --> 42:31.924
Hurry.

42:34.969 --> 42:36.220
NO ENTRY

42:42.059 --> 42:43.852
If it was for you,

42:45.896 --> 42:48.357
I thought I wouldn't mind dying.

42:59.994 --> 43:00.911
But…

43:02.413 --> 43:03.581
I miss you.

43:14.675 --> 43:16.844
I wasn't afraid of dying,

43:19.805 --> 43:22.975
but the thought of never seeing you again
was terrifying.

43:28.188 --> 43:29.023
Are you outside?

43:30.983 --> 43:32.067
Who are you?

43:33.652 --> 43:34.612
Open the door.

43:38.449 --> 43:39.533
Open it.

43:41.410 --> 43:44.330
Open it right now!

43:54.757 --> 43:55.674
Do you

43:56.842 --> 43:59.386
want to play with me?

44:01.430 --> 44:02.389
Let's play.

44:04.600 --> 44:07.728
There's a lot of fun stuff here.

44:07.811 --> 44:10.230
Let's play with these.

44:15.903 --> 44:18.322
Let's play!

44:44.348 --> 44:46.058
Stop!

45:02.908 --> 45:04.743
When I get out of here,

45:04.827 --> 45:06.412
I'm going to kill you!

45:07.371 --> 45:09.873
Open it! Open the door!

45:12.042 --> 45:13.377
- Open the door!
- Open it.

45:15.379 --> 45:18.465
I'm going to kill you
when I get out of here!

45:21.218 --> 45:22.886
- Open it!
- I saw everything.

45:23.887 --> 45:25.889
You two exchanged glances.

45:25.973 --> 45:26.974
Don't move!

45:27.057 --> 45:28.684
- Don't move!
- What are you doing?

45:28.767 --> 45:30.144
What are you doing?

45:32.521 --> 45:34.898
Something felt off, so I followed you.

45:34.982 --> 45:37.067
- Who knew you'd come here?
- Open it!

45:38.110 --> 45:40.821
Who knew you'd hide him here?

45:40.904 --> 45:42.739
Open the door!

45:43.490 --> 45:44.783
Now.

45:46.160 --> 45:47.744
I will pay

45:49.288 --> 45:50.956
for my actions myself.

45:52.541 --> 45:53.459
Open…

45:56.128 --> 45:57.129
that door.

45:57.212 --> 45:59.715
Open the door!

46:56.355 --> 46:59.191
It's been a while, Father.

47:00.442 --> 47:01.944
What's this for?

47:03.403 --> 47:04.738
Are you going to shoot me?

47:09.117 --> 47:10.452
He…

47:13.121 --> 47:15.249
takes after you a lot.

47:22.881 --> 47:23.882
Mr. Paik!

47:31.974 --> 47:33.183
It was great to see you.

47:33.850 --> 47:34.685
Goodbye.

47:35.852 --> 47:37.312
Father.

48:14.349 --> 48:16.685
Sis.

48:21.940 --> 48:23.525
Sis!

48:29.781 --> 48:31.658
Why did you leave me behind?

48:32.618 --> 48:35.203
Let's play some more!

49:01.063 --> 49:03.273
Help. Help me…

49:13.533 --> 49:14.785
I found you.

49:44.439 --> 49:45.482
Hee-joo.

50:01.164 --> 50:01.998
Hee-joo.

50:15.762 --> 50:16.596
Are you okay?

50:17.222 --> 50:18.181
Are you hurt?

50:18.265 --> 50:19.182
I'm okay.

50:25.856 --> 50:27.023
Let's go.

50:35.824 --> 50:36.783
Let's go home.

50:37.451 --> 50:38.535
It's all over now.

50:39.578 --> 50:40.579
It's not over.

50:42.247 --> 50:45.584
He's nearby, and he has a gun.

50:46.418 --> 50:47.502
Get out of here.

50:48.086 --> 50:49.963
We'll search the area and arrest him.

50:50.589 --> 50:51.840
Thank you.

51:00.766 --> 51:01.600
Okay.

51:02.309 --> 51:04.186
I'm going to follow the spokesperson.

51:04.269 --> 51:06.313
The rest of you split up
and search the area.

51:06.897 --> 51:10.442
Be careful. The suspect is armed.
Request backup from the nearby precinct!

51:10.525 --> 51:11.651
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

51:25.874 --> 51:28.210
Hee-joo, you have to stay awake.

51:29.002 --> 51:30.337
Let's go to the hospital.

51:31.171 --> 51:32.088
Just hold on.

52:14.965 --> 52:16.091
Where are you going?

52:17.342 --> 52:18.760
Let's play.

52:24.182 --> 52:26.643
Paik Sa-eon, get out of the car.

52:36.611 --> 52:37.445
Hee-joo.

52:39.197 --> 52:40.115
Listen to me.

52:40.907 --> 52:43.285
Don't get out of this car. Stay here.

52:44.286 --> 52:45.495
No, don't go.

52:46.246 --> 52:47.497
Get out!

52:49.207 --> 52:50.876
No! No…

52:53.420 --> 52:54.546
I have to end this.

52:55.922 --> 52:57.007
Don't come out.

53:16.568 --> 53:20.030
This is between us.
Don't drag her into this anymore.

53:26.536 --> 53:27.913
Do you think you won?

53:31.041 --> 53:32.542
But…

53:33.209 --> 53:34.544
did you…

53:36.504 --> 53:37.756
really win?

53:37.839 --> 53:39.633
I never wanted to beat you.

53:40.675 --> 53:41.509
I told you.

53:42.469 --> 53:44.220
I didn't want to take what's yours.

53:47.766 --> 53:48.642
Yeah.

53:49.309 --> 53:50.560
You just

53:51.186 --> 53:54.856
want to live happily ever after
with Hong Hee-joo.

53:54.940 --> 53:55.941
But…

53:57.567 --> 53:59.569
do you remember what I said before?

54:00.278 --> 54:01.196
I told you

54:02.113 --> 54:03.073
I wanted

54:04.115 --> 54:08.328
to see you suffer properly.

54:09.829 --> 54:12.165
Aren't you guilty of anything?

54:15.877 --> 54:17.045
Of course, you are.

54:18.380 --> 54:19.589
You're the son…

54:21.549 --> 54:23.051
of Paik Jang-ho,

54:23.927 --> 54:25.011
a man full of sins.

54:38.900 --> 54:39.734
What's that?

54:43.697 --> 54:44.614
Suspect sighted.

54:45.281 --> 54:46.282
Requesting backup.

56:37.852 --> 56:39.270
Yeah!

56:41.022 --> 56:42.232
That's it.

56:52.951 --> 56:54.786
That is the face

56:55.829 --> 56:57.247
I wanted to see from you.

57:02.585 --> 57:03.503
Put the gun down!

57:27.652 --> 57:28.653
Hong Hee-joo,

57:29.487 --> 57:31.114
do you like being married to me

57:31.823 --> 57:32.991
or not?

57:35.702 --> 57:36.870
If you don't hate it,

57:37.662 --> 57:40.665
how about we slowly
get to know each other better?

57:56.139 --> 57:57.557
I'd like that.

58:03.855 --> 58:05.231
I like you.

58:09.944 --> 58:11.196
What?

58:18.328 --> 58:20.079
I've liked you

58:21.331 --> 58:23.208
for a long time now.

58:24.918 --> 58:26.461
Since when?

58:27.921 --> 58:29.172
When we were kids.

58:39.474 --> 58:40.934
Since the moment

58:42.101 --> 58:43.520
you carried me on your back.

58:46.648 --> 58:47.899
I should've told you

58:49.234 --> 58:51.486
when you were still by my side.

58:52.362 --> 58:55.907
I shouldn't have hidden it
or kept it a secret.

58:56.950 --> 58:58.284
I should've told you

58:59.327 --> 59:01.746
that I've liked you for such a long time.

59:34.445 --> 59:35.446
It's so pretty.

01:00:26.331 --> 01:00:28.291
- Something's burning!
- What?

01:00:30.418 --> 01:00:31.377
No!

01:00:32.003 --> 01:00:33.296
My steak!

01:00:33.421 --> 01:00:35.548
No!

01:00:37.467 --> 01:00:38.384
Oh, no.

01:00:39.093 --> 01:00:40.094
What do we do?

01:00:40.928 --> 01:00:41.929
Look at the smoke!

01:00:42.805 --> 01:00:45.224
- It's on fire!
- It's all burnt. What do we do?

01:00:45.308 --> 01:00:46.726
I can't see the steak!

01:00:47.435 --> 01:00:48.603
It's okay.

01:01:02.909 --> 01:01:03.910
Only now,

01:01:05.745 --> 01:01:07.163
after he's gone,

01:01:08.456 --> 01:01:09.999
do I regret belatedly.

01:01:26.724 --> 01:01:29.686
The number you called is not in service.

01:01:29.769 --> 01:01:32.355
Please check the number and try again.

01:01:38.569 --> 01:01:41.698
The number you called is not in service.

01:01:41.781 --> 01:01:44.117
Please check the number and try again.

01:01:46.202 --> 01:01:48.913
PAIK SA-EON

01:01:52.375 --> 01:01:53.376
What did he…

01:01:57.922 --> 01:02:00.007
hear that day?

01:02:03.177 --> 01:02:04.762
What made him…

01:02:07.682 --> 01:02:10.643
look at me with such sad eyes?

01:02:25.616 --> 01:02:27.827
INCOMING CALL
INTERNATIONAL CALL

01:02:29.370 --> 01:02:30.371
Hello?

01:02:35.918 --> 01:02:36.919
Hello?

01:02:46.429 --> 01:02:47.680
Is that…

01:02:51.726 --> 01:02:52.727
you?

01:03:33.851 --> 01:03:35.853
Subtitle translation by: Sue Mounce
